WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.137
Tor dumped her bag.

2
00:00:07.138 --> 00:00:10.217
Nuts spilled everywhere.

3
00:00:10.218 --> 00:00:19.224
Rex groaned. "Another mess!"

4
00:00:19.225 --> 00:00:23.662
Tor grinned. "Sorry."

5
00:00:23.663 --> 00:00:27.794
The buddies picked up the nuts.

6
00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:30.346
Sid threw some.

7
00:00:30.347 --> 00:00:35.581
"Stop!" a squirrel yelled.

8
00:00:35.582 --> 00:00:37.896
She was in a tree.

9
00:00:37.897 --> 00:00:40.547
She peeked out from a hole.

10
00:00:40.548 --> 00:00:43.111
The squirrel was mad.

11
00:00:43.112 --> 00:00:47.506
"I'm collecting those nuts!"

12
00:00:47.507 --> 00:00:51.040
"What?" Rex said.

13
00:00:51.041 --> 00:00:55.973
"I was making a nut pile," the squirrel said.

14
00:00:55.974 --> 00:01:01.008
"I carried some nuts up here."

15
00:01:01.009 --> 00:01:03.605
The squirrel frowned.

16
00:01:03.606 --> 00:01:12.071
"My pile got messed up.

17
00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:14.580
So I hid nuts in that."

18
00:01:14.581 --> 00:01:17.997
She pointed to Tor's bag.

19
00:01:17.998 --> 00:01:21.393
"We were cleaning," Sara said.

20
00:01:21.394 --> 00:01:25.690
"We're sorry."

21
00:01:25.691 --> 00:01:31.005
"We can help you now," Tor said.

22
00:01:31.006 --> 00:01:35.620
The buddies collected nuts.

23
00:01:35.621 --> 00:01:47.138
Tor put them in her bag.

24
00:01:47.139 --> 00:01:50.229
Tor flew up to the squirrel.

25
00:01:50.230 --> 00:01:52.821
"Here," Tor said.

26
00:01:52.822 --> 00:02:02.584
The squirrel smiled. "Thanks!"

27
00:02:02.585 --> 00:02:06.186
Now the spot was clean.

28
00:02:06.187 --> 00:02:15.398
Rex roared. "Let's play!"

